":25907608,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTA3NjA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25907608?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stijn-h","html_url":"https://github.com/stijn-h","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stijn-h/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stijn-h/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stijn-h/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stijn-h/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stijn-h/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stijn-h/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stijn-h/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stijn-h/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stijn-h/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-17T21:57:20Z","updated_at":"2025-01-17T21:57:20Z","body":"I think it should just be fully reverted? The two buttons together are too much on small monitors. I do wish there was a way to do the single click access to the quick load menu like in unity, where it works well, but it will need a different approach.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599280905/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2614401428","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101244#issuecomment-2614401428","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101244","id":2614401428,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6b1JmU","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-26T12:37:01Z","updated_at":"2025-01-26T21:48:05Z","body":"Adding Quick Load to the menu makes sense. I've been using the new resource picker for a while and the new button is fine; it does take space, but not a big deal. However for people used to the old workflow, using quick open is now slower (until you remember to use the button at least).\r\n\r\nFor a more drastic solution, we could show New buttons when right-clicking the resource and other options when clicking the arrow button. Right now both show the same menu. Though that might be not very intuitive.\r\n\r\nEDIT:\r\nOk in Theme Editor this does not look very good.\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/20ac6ee7-76ea-45e7-ab77-fffcb777b2f1)\r\nidk if one less click is worth the lost space.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2614401428/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2625592502","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101244#issuecomment-2625592502","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101244","id":2625592502,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cf1y2","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-30T21:04:59Z","updated_at":"2025-01-30T21:04:59Z","body":"For now I'm going with a revert to the previous state in #102196.\r\n\r\nI still think there's merit to the idea of making the Quick Load option easier to access, so I think we should revisit this for 4.5. I've seen both complaints but also praise about the change so there's definitely something to do here UX wise.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2625592502/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2625699937","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101244#issuecomment-2625699937","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101244","id":2625699937,"node_id":"IC_k